# Observability, Storage, Domain (BC6)

- `run_journal.py` = filesystem persistence; `run_control.py` = active run registry; `run_manager.py` = shim only.
- Artifacts: content-addressed via `ArtifactStore` + handlers from `ArtifactSerializerRegistry`.
- Domain services (`app/domain/`) must not be imported by platform storage code.
- Models under `app/models/` are PortDataTypes; audio serialization registers at process start.
- Detail: `.kiro/steering/backend-services.md`, `data-models.md`, `docs/BACKEND_CORE.md`.
